From d167e3de2f4a775aa5d87d594f8dde29000584fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mateus Seiboth <mateusseiboth@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 16:37:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] device-xiaomi-lisa: new device

Xiaomi 11 Lite 5G NE / 11 LE (SM7325). Boots straight from the stock ABL:
header v3 boot.img and vendor_boot with the stock load addresses, a dtbo
with a no-op overlay in the format the ABL expects, and verified boot
disabled in vbmeta. An initramfs hook cycles the panel once, since the
first DSI bring-up after the bootloader hand-off leaves it dark.

Display, GPU, touchscreen, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, battery, modem, speaker,
earpiece, macro and ultra-wide cameras work.
